  "historyNote": "#9610, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-10; ss by #12655, EXEMPT, eff 11-1-18; ss by #12843, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-19; ss by #13637, EXEMPT, eff 5-17-23; ss by #14000, EXEMPT, eff 6-18-24",
